            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.19.1</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>Connecting a Google account works again when another app is busy.</b>
      Adding or reconnecting Gmail could fail with a plain "Couldn't connect"
      when another app on your Mac happened to be using the connection Jarvis
      signs in through. Jarvis now uses a free one instead. Microsoft Teams
      gets the same fix.</li>
  <li><b>A quieter Meetings popover.</b> The menu-bar Meetings popover is now
      two rows and one button.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
